---
// What a contractor gets after Jesse takes a call. The caller is made up.
---
<figure class="reveal">
  <div class="bg-paper text-charcoal border border-term-line shadow-[10px_10px_0_0_#E85D00]">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between px-5 py-3 border-b border-charcoal/15 font-mono text-[12px] text-pencil">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="dot-live"></span> NEW CALL &middot; 7:42 PM</span>
      <span>from Jesse</span>
    </div>
    <div class="px-5 pt-5 pb-2">
      <p class="font-semibold text-[19px] tracking-tight leading-snug">Water coming through the kitchen ceiling after the storm</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="px-5 pb-5 text-[15px]">
      <div class="flex gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-pencil pt-1">Caller</dt>
        <dd>Dana Whitfield</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-pencil pt-1">Number</dt>
        <dd class="font-mono text-[14px]">(217) 555-0142</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-pencil pt-1">Needs</dt>
        <dd>Roof leak over the kitchen. Shingles missing on the back slope. Wants a tarp tonight and a repair quote.</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4 py-2.5 border-b border-charcoal/10">
        <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-pencil pt-1">Job site</dt>
        <dd>1418 Linden Ave</dd>
      </div>
      <div class="flex gap-4 pt-3 items-center">
        <dt class="w-24 shrink-0 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-pencil">Urgency</dt>
        <dd><span class="inline-block bg-term text-paper font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-1">Tonight</span></dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-6 font-mono text-[12px] text-term-muted">An example of the email Jesse sends after a call.</figcaption>
</figure>
